  "description": "On\u202f1723456789 (Unix epoch) an EiffelArtifactCreatedEvent (version\u202f1.1.0) was recorded with the identifier\u202f123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000. The event is tagged \u201cartifact\u201d and \u201crelease\u201d. It originated from the Maven Builder (host\u202fbuild.example.com, domain\u202fexample.com) whose UI endpoint is\u202fhttps://build.example.com/jobs/123. The builder uses the serializer\u202forg.apache.maven:maven-core:3.8.4. For security, the SDM section lists the author as\u202fjohn.doe@example.com and provides the encrypted digest\u202fa1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90.\n\nThe artifact created is identified by the GAV coordinates\u202fcom.example:my-library:1.0.0 and is named \u201cMy Library Artifact\u201d. It was produced with the command\u202f\u201cmvn clean install\u201d. Two accompanying files were generated: a sources JAR (classifier\u202fsources, extension\u202fjar) and a Javadoc JAR (classifier\u202fjavadoc, extension\u202fjar). The artifact\u2019s implementation requirement is set to\u202fANY. It declares a dependency on\u202forg.apache.commons:commons-lang3:3.12.0 and implements the interface\u202fcom.example.interfaces:my\u2011interface:2.1.0. A custom data entry records release notes: \u201cInitial release of My Library.\u201d\n\nThis event is linked to a cause event identified by\u202f9b2d5c8f-4a1e-4e2b-9d3c-7f8a6c9e0b12.",
